          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-10 text-slate-900">
            Planexus solves the three Munich bottlenecks at which laboratory projects regularly fail
          </h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border-l-4 border-primary rounded-xl p-6">
              <div class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Föhn destabilises the pressure cascade</div>
