            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border-l-4 border-primary rounded-xl p-6">
              <div class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Large-scale research demands vibration classes below 1 µm/s</div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Large-scale research in Garching with a research reactor and neutron source, the biomedical research institutes in Martinsried and research centres in Neuherberg demand vibration tolerances below 1 µm/s for beam diagnostics, cryo-EM and high-precision analytics. Standard containers without spring isolation do not reach this class.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-900 font-semibold mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200">Planexus response: VC-D bearing to VDI 2038 configured at the factory.</p>
            </div>
