              <div class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">LBK Munich reviews differently from 25 internal city-district practices</div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">Inside the city boundary the Munich Local Building Commission is the central authority — but its 25 city-district units review with different stringency. Outside (Garching, Martinsried, Penzberg, Ottobrunn) rural district offices are competent. Anyone who submits a generic template collects revision requests.</p>
