            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5"><div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary shrink-0 w-14">01</div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">We listen</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Requirements workshop on site in Munich or by video. Which biosafety level, which campus, which standard, which date — föhn load case and vibration class asked explicitly.</p></div></div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5"><div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary shrink-0 w-14">02</div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">We plan</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">CAD layout, building services (TGA) and structural design. BayBO-compliant building documents for LBK Munich or the competent Landratsamt — procedure-ready from day 1. LGL preparation for BSL-3, radiation-protection concept for Garching.</p></div></div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5"><div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary shrink-0 w-14">03</div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">We build</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Module prefabrication at the certified Polish partner; final assembly and interior fit-out at the Albstadt works with Wesemann furniture. Föhn-stable HVAC and raft foundation pre-configured at the factory. A factory visit is possible at any time — only 280 km from Munich.</p></div></div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5"><div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary shrink-0 w-14">04</div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">We deliver</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Heavy-goods transport A8 (280 km, 1 transport day). Installation by mobile crane onto a raft foundation. Connection of all services, functional and leak tests before handover — HVAC föhn load case tested live.</p></div></div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 flex gap-5"><div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary shrink-0 w-14">05</div><div><h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">We hand over</h3><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">IQ/OQ/PQ documentation. Training for your operators. Maintenance options for up to 24 months — extendable on request.</p></div></div>
          </div>
